{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-dos-hermanas-jamb-rosette",
  "title": "Rosette of the arch jambs in the Sala de las Dos Hermanas, Alhambra",
  "short": "Dos Hermanas jamb rosette",
  "subtitle": "Alhambra, Granada: Sala de las Dos Hermanas, north arch",
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of the red star.",
    "A": "Sets the circle through the star’s points, on the line of the tile’s middle."
  },
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s NC2 drawing. Every line runs at 22.5° to the square repeat. Turned by 22.5°, the band centre lines snap to the square-root-of-two grid in units of the red star’s point radius, and the four line directions share one set of distances from O. So all lines are perpendiculars to the 22.5° line through O, marked by compass transfers and turned by 45°. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The 9 pt bands are represented by their centre lines. Our lines were laid over David Wade’s photograph SPA 1803 of the jamb and follow its white bands; no difference from the drawing was found. The colours follow Wichmann’s approximate drawing on the Alhambra palette (his red as honey-brown); the jamb itself also has purple pieces.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data174/NC2: Alhambra, Granada: Sala de las Dos Hermanas, north arch",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data174/NC2.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. He drew it from Nick Crossling’s photograph (personal communication) of the ceramic mosaic on the east and west jambs of the north arch from the Sala de las Dos Hermanas into the Sala de los Ajimeces (1354–62). His other references are David Wade’s photograph SPA 1803 and Wichmann and Wade, Islamic Design: a Mathematical Approach (2017), figure 9.6c."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a circle with centre O through A."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. It crosses the circle at C. Draw the line through O that halves the angle AOC. It crosses the circle at E, above A. Draw the line through O that halves the angle AOE. Draw the line through O that halves the angle EOC. Draw a line through O at 90° to each of these two lines. The circle crosses the four new lines at S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "C"]}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "r22": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "E"]}},
        "r67": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["E", "O", "C"]}},
        "r112": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "r157": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "r67"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r22"], "pick": {"angle": 22.5}}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r67"], "pick": {"angle": 67.5}}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r112"], "pick": {"angle": 112.5}}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r157"], "pick": {"angle": 157.5}}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r22"], "pick": {"angle": 202.5}}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r67"], "pick": {"angle": 247.5}}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r112"], "pick": {"angle": 292.5}}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "r157"], "pick": {"angle": 337.5}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw the star at O as two squares.",
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The line from S8 to S2 crosses the line through O and S1 at P. Draw a circle with centre S1 through O. It crosses the line through O and S1 at F, beyond S1. Draw a circle with centre F and radius OP. It crosses the line through O and S1 at M1 and M2.",
      "create": {
        "P": {"point": {"meet": ["q14", "r22"]}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "S1", "through": "O"}},
        "F": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cf": {"circle": {"centre": "F", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "M1": {"point": {"meet": ["cf", "r22"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "M2": {"point": {"meet": ["cf", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Keep the compass open from S1 to S3. Draw circles with centres M2 and M3 in turn. They cross the line through O and S1 at M3 and M4, beyond their centres. Draw a circle with centre M3 and radius OF. It crosses the line through O and S1 at M5, beyond M3. Keep the compass open from S1 to S3 again. Draw circles with centres M5 and M6 in turn. They cross the line through O and S1 at M6 and M7, beyond their centres.",
      "create": {
        "cm3": {"circle": {"centre": "M2", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "M3": {"point": {"meet": ["cm3", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cm4": {"circle": {"centre": "M3", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "M4": {"point": {"meet": ["cm4", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cm5": {"circle": {"centre": "M3", "radiusFrom": ["O", "F"]}},
        "M5": {"point": {"meet": ["cm5", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cm6": {"circle": {"centre": "M5", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "M6": {"point": {"meet": ["cm6", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cm7": {"circle": {"centre": "M6", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "M7": {"point": {"meet": ["cm7", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Keep the compass open from S1 to S3. Draw circles with centres P and Q1 in turn. They cross the line through O and S1 at Q1 and Q2, beyond their centres.",
      "create": {
        "cq1": {"circle": {"centre": "P", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "Q1": {"point": {"meet": ["cq1", "r22"], "pick": {"angle": 22.5}}},
        "cq2": {"circle": {"centre": "Q1", "radiusFrom": ["S1", "S3"]}},
        "Q2": {"point": {"meet": ["cq2", "r22"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Draw a line through each of M1 to M7 and Q2 at 90° to the line through O and S1. Turn the eight new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "pm1": {"line": {"through": "M1", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm2": {"line": {"through": "M2", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pq2": {"line": {"through": "Q2", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm3": {"line": {"through": "M3", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm4": {"line": {"through": "M4", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm5": {"line": {"through": "M5", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm6": {"line": {"through": "M6", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pm7": {"line": {"through": "M7", "perpendicularTo": "r22"}},
        "pp": {"repeat": {"of": ["pm1", "pm2", "pq2", "pm3", "pm4", "pm5", "pm6", "pm7"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The line through M6 crosses the horizontal line at T1. Draw a circle with centre O through T1. It crosses the horizontal and vertical lines at T2, T3 and T4. Draw a vertical line through each of T1 and T3. Draw a horizontal line through each of T2 and T4. They make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "T1": {"point": {"meet": ["pm6", "h"]}},
        "co": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "T1"}},
        "T2": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "T3": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "T4": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "T1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "T2", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "T3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "T4", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}}
      },
      "animate": "compass",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The line through M6 crosses its copy turned by 315° at T1. Draw a circle with centre O through T1. It crosses the vertical line at T2 and T4. It crosses the line through M6, turned by 180°, at T3, level with T1. Draw a vertical line through each of T1 and T3. Draw a horizontal line through each of T2 and T4. They make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
